{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Brawls in the Wild West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawlers of the West: Prologue</strong> is a <strong>free, physics-based Western brawler</strong> delivering brutal close-quarters combat in the lawless frontier. Every punch, kick, shove, and throw is driven by physics, creating raw, unpredictable brawls where no two fights play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue offers a focused taste of the full game\u2019s combat system, atmosphere, and game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully driven by physics. Strikes carry real weight, enemies lose balance, collide with the environment, and react dynamically to every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing, positioning, and aggression define every encounter. One well-placed blow can end a fight \u2014 while reckless movement leaves you exposed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn the Environment Against Your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is part of the fight.<br>Smash bottles, break furniture, and slam enemies into walls to gain the upper hand. Each arena supports <strong>emergent, unscripted combat</strong>, ensuring chaotic and memorable brawls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Modes in the Free Prologue</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss of the Saloon</strong> \u2013 Face powerful opponents in intense boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Four teams of two battle until only one team remains</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These modes are available in the Prologue with a <strong>limited selection of levels</strong>, offering a strong preview of the full game\u2019s variety and intensity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fight Continues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Prologue is only the beginning. The full version of <strong>Brawlers of the West</strong> expands the experience with more arenas, fighters, game modes, and escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist the full game</strong> to follow development and be ready for the complete Wild West brawling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308230?t=1771422228","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308230?t=1771422228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308230/3cc1aff70940eae9fe9ceb2fd70487cb26f5a8b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771422228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308230/3cc1aff70940eae9fe9ceb2fd70487cb26f5a8b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771422228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Brawls in the Wild West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawlers of the West: Prologue</strong> is a <strong>free, physics-based Western brawler</strong> delivering brutal close-quarters combat in the lawless frontier. Every punch, kick, shove, and throw is driven by physics, creating raw, unpredictable brawls where no two fights play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue offers a focused taste of the full game\u2019s combat system, atmosphere, and game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully driven by physics. Strikes carry real weight, enemies lose balance, collide with the environment, and react dynamically to every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing, positioning, and aggression define every encounter. One well-placed blow can end a fight \u2014 while reckless movement leaves you exposed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn the Environment Against Your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is part of the fight.<br>Smash bottles, break furniture, and slam enemies into walls to gain the upper hand. Each arena supports <strong>emergent, unscripted combat</strong>, ensuring chaotic and memorable brawls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Modes in the Free Prologue</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss of the Saloon</strong> \u2013 Face powerful opponents in intense boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Four teams of two battle until only one team remains</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These modes are available in the Prologue with a <strong>limited selection of levels</strong>, offering a strong preview of the full game\u2019s variety and intensity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fight Continues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Prologue is only the beginning. The full version of <strong>Brawlers of the West</strong> expands the experience with more arenas, fighters, game modes, and escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist the full game</strong> to follow development and be ready for the complete Wild West brawling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Inogames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308230/header.jpg?t=1771422228","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3308230/775668/25d8bde9577543cbeeeb936d404dffba27200448/1750977786/dash_av1.mpd?t=1730876572","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3308230/775668/25d8bde9577543cbe